msgid "这份页面回答两个问题："
msgstr "This page answers two questions:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:10
#: 45982b09de18450a878d4f68da81b686
msgid "多张卡片应该按什么顺序排"
msgstr "In what order should multiple cards be connected?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:11
#: 26729b3aba9e4965b2d2185c95690ab5
msgid "每一步大概会生成什么样的结果"
msgstr "What kind of output should each step produce?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:14
#: abf2aeeca6cc4afd9653637930b87893
msgid ""
"下面的 JSON 采用“卡片配置片段”的写法，字段名与当前 `to_dict()` 保持一致，可直"
"接对照卡片页里的推荐预设填写。第一版 recipes 不依赖截图，也不绑定固定示例文"
"件。"
msgstr ""
"The JSON examples below are card-configuration fragments. Their field names "
"match the current `to_dict()` output, so you can compare them directly with "
"the presets on each card page. The recipes are independent of screenshots "
"and do not require a particular example file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:17
#: 5b0b7fba83b54c3cacfe3763a3320a40
msgid ""
"每条配方的卡片链只负责生成候选池。链条末尾写的 `NEP Dataset Display 清洗 → "
"FPS` 表示后处理方向：先在 `NEP Dataset Display` 里删掉明显异常结构，再做代表"
"性采样。 如果你有当前体系的 NEP 模型，可以用它做预筛；没有时可以先做几何检查"
"和人工抽查。"
msgstr ""
"Each card chain generates a candidate pool, not a labeled training set. The "
"final `clean in NEP Dataset Display → FPS` step means: remove obvious "
"failures first, then select representative structures. An existing NEP model "
"for the same chemical system may help with preliminary screening; otherwise "
"begin with geometry checks and manual inspection. In either case, final "
"labels still come from the chosen reference calculation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:21
#: cec973c514404c3e899097f34b6a165c
msgid "高熵合金"
msgstr "High-entropy alloy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:23
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:141
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:248
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:318
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:418
#: ac80f9463dcd44e786ad29cb2028436b 8610a9c774b74632895c307f6390fb1b
#: 3366a187c3b246be9549c547181b9adc d534fb07f8ea4ac9becf785be5742858
#: fe792ff0a43d4bf19330503978b9f90a
msgid "目标说明"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:25
#: 4bb0ad7936304de4a518fb5333f23662
msgid ""
"从单一晶体原型出发，系统扫描多组目标配比，并把目标配比真正落到原子占位上，最"
"后补一轮随机掺杂扩大局部化学环境。"
msgstr ""
"Start from one crystal prototype, scan a set of target compositions, realize "
"each composition on atomic sites, and finally add modest random "
"substitutions to broaden local chemical environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:27
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:145
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:252
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:322
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:422
#: 5a4474843a5247899710d93280c2a7d1 444c979d3b13499c871682d78b6a53a6
#: 4d3c42fb3c024f4ea77c8b2d8550df7d fccaaf8ab44d4047b391bd3907f1824f
#: d84b4925e125447da84b3a3cd5ed0d43
msgid "输入假设"
msgstr "Input assumptions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:29
#: bd16866265f64b85864ea5546261d940
msgid ""
"已有一个体相母相结构，或者先用 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 生成基础结构。"
msgstr ""
"A bulk parent structure is available, or one will be generated with `Crystal "
"Prototype Builder`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:30
#: 947d4e9221a7438e95679082216688e3
msgid "目标元素集合为 `Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`。"
msgstr "The target element set is `Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:31
#: 1b8ca976af3747a5a50902149af37fb2
msgid "希望最终拿到“多配比 + 多随机占位”的 HEA 训练集。"
msgstr ""
"The desired candidate pool covers several compositions and several random "
"occupations per composition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:33
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:150
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:258
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:327
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:427
#: 1878492f731846b7b8dae88a6b7a235e b23b327b17514e7fa9f56f43634767d3
#: 6d375971d94b48209e344619e4c73159 e65a33cd7d3c42de8c0b55d932ff7cc5
#: 7e9b84f2b32e46d7ab63703c650c046f
msgid "卡片顺序"
msgstr "Card order"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:35
#: 1e230f2925c445f19ace1da42f8fd31b
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Composition Space Sampling → Random Occupancy → "
"Random Doping → 导出 xyz → NEP Dataset Display 清洗 → FPS`"
msgstr "`Crystal Prototype Builder → Composition Space Sampling → Random Occupancy → Random Doping → export xyz → clean in NEP Dataset Display → FPS`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:37
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:154
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:262
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:331
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:431
#: 4b78e86e8dcb486ea0e3d962b5e2e959 0a01f702df4a4dbba263c57546ca0085
#: fda9d415ad4d4702ae72b314969f6d31 592f9fb94b8e4a57ab37fade4cffc9a8
#: 054b0da00d0747a7821609da0ec64ffe
msgid "每步 JSON 配置"
msgstr "JSON for each step"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:39
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:264
#: 472db5b1941d4a3c91babd0a3da1c527 e53bb1764693412da7c5d7da3e11e5bd
msgid "Step 1. `Crystal Prototype Builder`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:41
#: a568b830373643788524c06a31838bac
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"fcc\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Ni\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.52, 3.52, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"auto_supercell\": true,\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 64,\n"
"    \"rep\": [2, 2, 2],\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:57
#: b9bc10d5fc194d0e9fb2132e1730d6e1
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 1 个基础 fcc 结构；原子数受 `max_atoms` 控制，适合作为后续"
"配比扫描母体。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** One base fcc structure whose atom count is controlled "
"by `max_atoms`, suitable as the parent for the composition scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:59
#: 069625a9e6324817b1d964481c9c5d55
msgid "Step 2. `Composition Space Sampling`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:61
#: 9569a3afb0fc43058105bc5a5431cb5d
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionSweepCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe\",\n"
"    \"order\": \"4,5\",\n"
"    \"method\": \"Sobol\",\n"
"    \"step\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"n_points\": 24,\n"
"    \"min_fraction\": 0.05,\n"
"    \"include_endpoints\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 24,\n"
"    \"budget_mode\": \"Equal+Reflow\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:80
#: 6260a4491d794aecb857923ae74f3dfa
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 24 个带 `Comp(...)` 标签的目标配比结构副本；此时还没有真正"
"替换原子位点。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** 24 structure copies labeled `Comp(...)`. These labels "
"define target compositions; atomic sites have not yet been reassigned."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:82
#: a0b0a3eacd314e6a83f3dce29704ad67
msgid "Step 3. `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:84
#: f522a5b3b0ab42fe900add23a370b9c8
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"    \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 2,\n"
"    \"group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:99
#: ae7aed07c61044828bf2266ac4b89b98
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 每个目标配比落点成 2 个离散占位结构；如果 Step 2 输出 24 "
"个配比点，这一步通常得到约 48 个随机合金候选。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Two discrete occupations for every target composition. "
"If Step 2 produced 24 composition points, this step usually produces about "
"48 random-alloy candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:101
#: 6be5abd14b2441338623aa5d51f9d75a
msgid "Step 4. `Random Doping`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:103
#: 4b8eb20d1a174a259f7914fa6f814284
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Ni\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Co\": 1.0, \"Cr\": 1.0},\n"
"        \"use\": \"count\",\n"
"        \"count_mode\": \"random\",\n"
"        \"count\": [1, 2],\n"
"        \"percent\": [0.0, 1.0]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 123\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:125
#: 115293a69448423f9f4e3269170e164a
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 对每个离散占位结构再扩出 2 个局部替换版本，进一步增加局部"
"环境多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Two additional local-substitution variants for each "
"discrete occupation, broadening local chemical diversity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:127
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:234
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:304
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:404
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:484
#: 46185436b0c0402a840718833424d648 b9d13ffc93e440b8aa620a728c6af473
#: 056a86419ce44f9c87c10f7e19b22f80 355df4bb39644939ab63302d5f7be19a
#: 5860fb9688a549f490cd5d0da3d7183e
msgid "最终数据集特征"
msgstr "Resulting candidate-pool coverage"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:129
#: 847f7b0475f64d7e976f45586ccd1596
msgid "同时覆盖四元和五元目标配比"
msgstr "Includes both quaternary and quinary target compositions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:130
#: 4d83c8918a6c4a1ca225d09bba9c8251
msgid "每个目标配比都落到了实际原子位点"
msgstr "Realizes every target composition on actual atomic sites"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:131
#: fc4f2849b85d4026b824a71a1165109d
msgid "局部化学环境不只来自占位，还来自额外随机替换"
msgstr "Combines occupation diversity with additional local substitutions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:133
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:240
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:310
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:410
#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:490
#: 6d20d48cd4c9426cadd341f561133110 c957f7e6793d4c918d316d40c13ba5f0
#: c86fd665b5bc477dbddc66aa37ab284f f091e970fd2547d8a65a327aed98bfb1
#: d5ecc43a50ba4959a51e3948fbd6fb45
msgid "常见失败点"
msgstr "Common failure modes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:135
#: 6ff31da719444952a2c7765bc164824b
msgid ""
"只做 `Composition Space Sampling` 就停止：这只定义目标配比，不代表已经得到真"
"实随机合金。"
msgstr "Stopping after `Composition Space Sampling`: this defines a target composition but does not produce a truly random alloy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:136
#: 5e29e7d129f642129e46bf09dda8530d
msgid ""
"`Random Occupancy` 的 `source` 没有读取 `Comp(...)`：会导致输出与目标配比不一"
"致。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` does not read `Comp(...)` as its `source`: realized "
"occupations can then disagree with the targets."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:137
#: 6fd22797464b41f39879c5448174928e
msgid "`Random Doping` 规则写得过重：容易把原本的目标配比拉偏。"
msgstr ""
"Overly aggressive `Random Doping` rules: they can shift the realized "
"composition away from the intended target."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:139
#: 8bfbfc4e2458475a99743a7324231827
msgid "富缺陷表面"
msgstr "Defect-rich surfaces"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:143
#: 2acaf7b466024ca4aaff5a97ba855ced
msgid ""
"从体相结构构造多取向表面，再在表面上加入插隙/吸附和空位，得到既有表面效应又有"
"缺陷效应的数据集。"
msgstr ""
"Construct several surface orientations from a bulk parent, then add "
"adsorbates or interstitials and vacancies to combine surface and defect "
"environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:147
#: 4182adbe0fce4d95b4f19aa2108acf3b
msgid "输入是已弛豫的体相晶体。"
msgstr "The input is a relaxed bulk crystal."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:148
#: dfd513993d5947d9a484e3cb7e480158
msgid "目标任务是表面反应、表面稳定性或富缺陷 slab 训练。"
msgstr ""
"The target task is a surface reaction, surface stability, or defect-rich "
"slab model."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:152
#: 856d585703b9482b89274a167d599ab3
msgid ""
"`Super Cell → Random Slab → Insert Defect → Vacancy Defect Generation → 导出 "
"xyz → NEP Dataset Display 清洗 → FPS`"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell → Random Slab → Insert Defect → Vacancy Defect Generation → "
"export XYZ → clean in NEP Dataset Display → FPS`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:156
#: a79d404840f64a4bafcb427c9b211aff
msgid "Step 1. `Super Cell`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:158
#: 3d4a0b0b9d424bc3b08a30d40d539b37
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"behavior_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"mode\": \"scale\",\n"
"    \"super_scale\": [2, 2, 1],\n"
"    \"target_cell\": [20.0, 20.0, 20.0],\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 200,\n"
"    \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, true],\n"
"    \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:173
#: aa07391a7c6b46fc83451c90ca4ece86
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 1 个横向扩展、法向保持 1 倍的母相结构；适合作为表面切片前"
"的体相输入。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** One parent structure enlarged in-plane while remaining "
"one cell thick along the intended normal, ready for slab cutting."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:175
#: 78e0d82285314adebecd6d5330cb1e88
msgid "Step 2. `Random Slab`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:177
#: 188e79fb42584b3289b59b2f5e4aae06
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"h_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"    \"k_range\": [0, 1, 1],\n"
"    \"l_range\": [1, 3, 1],\n"
"    \"layer_range\": [4, 8, 1],\n"
"    \"vacuum_range\": [12, 18, 2]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:190
#: 95e11ed9256c40d99715d221479e0f62
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 多个低指数到中低指数 slab；真空层足够隔离上下表面，输出通"
"常已经明显多于 Step 1。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Several low- to moderate-index slabs. Verify that the "
"selected vacuum separates periodic images; the output count is already "
"larger than in Step 1."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:192
#: 3e7a74cdfe2843eb8c868b6dd3e4ccf2
msgid "Step 3. `Insert Defect`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:194
#: bfb36fb80e944ea5a2cb4123543d43fb
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"InsertDefectCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": 1,\n"
"    \"species\": \"H,O\",\n"
"    \"insert_count\": 1,\n"
"    \"structure_count\": 2,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.2,\n"
"    \"max_attempts\": 50,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7,\n"
"    \"axis\": 2,\n"
"    \"offset\": 1.5\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:212
#: 505623cd011147a08981331288dab227
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 每个 slab 再生成 2 个上表面随机吸附候选；这里只做连续横向"
"采样和最小距离约束，不识别顶位、桥位或空位。"
msgstr "**Expected output at each step:** generate two additional random upper-surface adsorption candidates per slab; this performs continuous lateral sampling with a minimum-distance constraint and does not identify top, bridge, or vacancy sites."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:214
#: c17ab0c96d71445e84d8c1ab77c5a566
msgid "Step 4. `Vacancy Defect Generation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:216
#: b158df7066e34efe99bb64ff23dcc7bf
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"VacancyDefectCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 1,\n"
"    \"num_condition\": 1,\n"
"    \"use_num\": false,\n"
"    \"concentration_condition\": 0.03,\n"
"    \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 3,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 19\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:232
#: a3ce038474274ee2a734ea79c5e5f71f
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 每个已有表面缺陷结构再扩出约 3 个轻度空位版本；空位强度受"
"浓度控制，而不是固定删位数。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** About three mild-vacancy variants for each existing "
"surface-defect structure. Vacancy strength is controlled by concentration, "
"not a fixed removal count."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:236
#: ed3eef9414c242c2ac92c5b714a1abf0
msgid "同时覆盖不同 slab 取向、厚度和真空层"
msgstr "Covers different slab orientations, thicknesses, and vacuum sizes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:237
#: 723029f940cf4cb794af8a8f923b57d6
msgid "既有表面，也有插隙/吸附和空位"
msgstr "Combines surfaces with interstitials or adsorbates and vacancies"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:238
#: 006350b02efb4fa887506a34a4cb3557
msgid "缺陷强度可控，适合做表面缺陷多样性训练"
msgstr ""
"Keeps defect concentration controllable while broadening surface-defect "
"environments"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:242
#: c040820392404d23aac6be4617d0a2ef
msgid "先做空位再做 slab：会把“体相删位”误当成“表面缺陷”。"
msgstr ""
"Creating vacancies before cutting slabs: bulk removals are then mistaken for "
"deliberately selected surface defects."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:243
#: 164d17adccfb4757882c02b609bf7e39
msgid "`vacuum_range` 过小：上下表面镜像相互作用会污染结果。"
msgstr ""
"An undersized `vacuum_range`: interactions between periodic slab images "
"contaminate the calculation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:244
#: 0b50fbab13a54728b1bea571c0b4401d
msgid "`concentration_condition` 设得过大：slab 太薄时容易直接破坏表面骨架。"
msgstr ""
"An excessive `concentration_condition`: a thin slab can lose its surface "
"framework."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:246
#: 7d379051968249969a4beee05b4ed048
msgid "GSFE 路径"
msgstr "GSFE path"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:250
#: bda8c8f106774a5697b0ce24be2e58dd
msgid ""
"为指定滑移系统生成一条未弛豫 GSFE 路径。这个配方适合模型在层错能、滑移势垒或"
"局部极小位置上明显偏离 DFT，而训练集中又缺少系统层间错排结构的情况。"
msgstr ""
"Generate an unrelaxed GSFE path for a specified slip system. Use this recipe "
"when stacking-fault energies, slip barriers, or local minima disagree with "
"DFT and the training set lacks a systematic interlayer-displacement path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:254
#: a374ade24da34ca5a85ca71bec346a37
msgid "研究对象是 fcc 金属或近 fcc 合金。"
msgstr "The material is an fcc metal or near-fcc alloy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:255
#: 5b57de26d75a491a93c8d2c289cbf6e4
msgid "目标是先扫 fcc (111) 面内完整周期路径，而不是生成带真空的自由表面。"
msgstr ""
"The goal is a complete periodic in-plane path on fcc (111), not a free "
"surface with vacuum."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:256
#: 16c6c7c8ee5c48c79ca81d3f7703e871
msgid "后续会对输出结构做 DFT 单点或短弛豫，再加入训练集。"
msgstr ""
"The outputs will receive DFT single-point calculations or short relaxations "
"before being added to the training set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:260
#: d1027c4f45574a7aacd3a5aff8792e67
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder(fcc111) → Stacking Fault / GSFE Path → 导出 xyz → "
"NEP Dataset Display 清洗 → DFT`"
msgstr "`Crystal Prototype Builder(fcc111) → Stacking Fault / GSFE Path → export xyz → clean in NEP Dataset Display → DFT`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:266
#: 67f6b3a313e7445498a3f3cff2db91a5
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"fcc111\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Ni\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.60, 3.60, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"auto_supercell\": false,\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 256,\n"
"    \"rep\": [2, 2, 2],\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:282
#: 9f412ef26794433dacd0912195234c04
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 1 个 slab-oriented 周期 cell。当前 cell 的 `(001)` 面对应"
"原始 fcc 的 `(111)` 面，第三晶胞方向已经垂直于层错面。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** One slab-oriented periodic cell. Its current `(001)` "
"plane corresponds to the original fcc `(111)` plane, and the third cell "
"vector is normal to the fault plane."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:284
#: 50947c5fc6f640cdbe58689ddd311736
msgid "Step 2. `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:286
#: 281bf8e07e2d4418a20ea5472c9af75c
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.1],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"fraction_of_vector\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"middle\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 0,\n"
"    \"wrap\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:302
#: 966fb515c879415b9f4c2fbe646d6e4c
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 11 个沿面内周期方向滑移的层错结构。第一个和最后一个结构应"
"回到同一个周期位置，中间结构用于 DFT 标注 GSFE 曲线。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Eleven structures displaced along a periodic in-plane "
"direction. The first and last represent equivalent periodic positions; "
"intermediate structures provide points for the DFT GSFE curve."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:306
#: c105bfc523f54280b14579832846db0e
msgid "覆盖完整滑移周期，而不是单个任意层错位移"
msgstr ""
"Covers a complete slip period rather than one arbitrary fault displacement"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:307
#: 9b99cc7c794540e6a454c3beb3d6d5d8
msgid "输出标签里保留 `hkl`、`uvw` 和位移量，方便回看曲线"
msgstr ""
"Preserves `hkl`, `uvw`, and displacement in output labels for reconstructing "
"the curve"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:308
#: ef0619a7ef7d4a8c9c90fcfda9a8312a
msgid ""
"输入几何满足 slab-oriented 要求，避免普通 cubic cell 直接扫 `(111)` 时产生错"
"接"
msgstr ""
"Uses geometry that satisfies the slab-orientation contract, avoiding an "
"invalid `(111)` scan in a conventional cubic cell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:312
#: 2dbe7229733f4e6ba863778761accaf8
msgid ""
"直接把普通 `fcc` cubic cell 送进 `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`：第三晶胞方向不"
"垂直于目标 `(111)` 面，程序会报 slab-oriented 错误。"
msgstr "Passing an ordinary `fcc` cubic cell directly to `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`: the third cell direction is not perpendicular to the target `(111)` plane, so the program reports a slab-oriented error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:313
#: 6e115ecf9b4a4fcb87e54e7a5da7035f
msgid ""
"把这里的 `fcc111` 当成真空表面：它是周期 cell，不含真空层；如果要自由表面，"
"用 `Random Slab`。"
msgstr ""
"Treating `fcc111` as a vacuum surface: it is a periodic oriented cell with "
"no vacuum. Use `Random Slab` for a free surface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:314
#: b4884ddb5f7b467cbe05bf5f7ba8479a
msgid ""
"位移步长太粗：0.1 适合第一轮覆盖；如果峰值附近曲线不平滑，把步长缩到 0.05。"
msgstr ""
"Using a displacement step that is too coarse: 0.1 is suitable for an initial "
"path, while 0.05 can resolve an insufficiently smooth peak region."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:316
#: 5678da667a2b423eaee85e1d261d8822
msgid "磁性数据"
msgstr "Magnetic data"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:320
#: ff3bd3732e754e648d7ae6f4c7a51789
msgid ""
"从一个磁性母相结构出发，先写入分组标签，再生成 FM / AFM / PM 分支，最后对已有"
"磁矩做旋转补样。"
msgstr ""
"Start from a magnetic parent, assign sublattice labels, generate FM, AFM, "
"and PM-like branches, then rotate existing moments for local directional "
"augmentation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:324
#: 409e6901a36b459ebb8c8a7818e211ec
msgid "输入结构是磁性材料。"
msgstr "The input structure is magnetic."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:325
#: c271a1e9e20c4f169267ff4319440cde
msgid "你希望同时覆盖多磁序，而不是只保留单一 MAGMOM 初始化。"
msgstr ""
"The candidate pool should cover several magnetic orders, not one MAGMOM "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:329
#: 71c21c1f4f74434289b59c0a3595198f
msgid "`Group Label → Magnetic Order → Magmom Rotation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:333
#: 5e8b96ff749847c4854c6848cfb9d063
msgid "Step 1. `Group Label`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:335
#: 13e4b3853f314d8cb18ee699a6a55a22
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"GroupLabelCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"overwrite\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:348
#: cc52da2522de4afa9bcd764ddf182591
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 1 个带 `group` 数组的结构；后续 `Magnetic Order` 若走 "
"`group A/B` 模式会直接使用这些标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** One structure with a `group` array. If `Magnetic Order` "
"uses group A/B mode, it reads these labels directly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:350
#: 4cd82f5228d14bb38da1c4a13aea2ab0
msgid "Step 2. `Magnetic Order`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:352
#: a39c103fc0844766b430775629e607e1
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"group_ab\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 8,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 88,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:381
#: fce8bff7dce3442dbb97afe0ccc0c437
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 得到 1 个 FM、1 个 AFM 和 8 个 PM 候选；"
"`afm_mode=group_ab` 时，真正起作用的是 `afm_group_a/b`，不是 `afm_kvec`。"
msgstr "**Expected output at each step:** obtain one FM, one AFM, and eight PM candidates; when `afm_mode=group_ab`, `afm_group_a/b` control the assignment, not `afm_kvec`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:383
#: 10e0d126a1c74927940380e12bc4adf5
msgid "Step 3. `Magmom Rotation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:385
#: 9204decfa2d94e36aaf018ccf601d273
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticMomentRotationCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"max_angle\": 15.0,\n"
"    \"num_structures\": 3,\n"
"    \"lift_scalar\": true,\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"disturb_magnitude\": false,\n"
"    \"magnitude_factor\": [1.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 99\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:402
#: f971e7d799ff4ed68d9e80dfa21263f4
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 对每个已有磁序结构再扩出 3 个小角度旋转版本，适合补充非共"
"线附近样本。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Three small-angle variants of each magnetic-order "
"structure, adding samples near the noncollinear neighborhood."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:406
#: d7554d7c1a814d5caf18ba6789acaea1
msgid "同时包含 FM、AFM、PM 和小角度旋转分支"
msgstr "Includes FM, AFM, PM-like, and small-angle branches"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:407
#: 9db6e96b0c7947f4b32ef84ffaffb4b2
msgid "AFM 的分组来源清晰，可追溯"
msgstr "Makes the AFM sublattice assignment explicit and traceable"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:408
#: 4baa3e5e97254365964e7d4e10337716
msgid "随机性由 seed 控制，可做重复实验"
msgstr "Controls random branches with a seed for repeatable comparisons"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:412
#: 7caa35e5ade745d59e748b8a5f8b9594
msgid "没有先提供 `magmom_map` 或合理 `default_moment`：生成的磁矩幅值会退化。"
msgstr ""
"Omitting `magmom_map` and a sensible `default_moment`: generated magnitudes "
"become zero or otherwise unsuitable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:413
#: 7e40aacb33b34a5e9b4d06ba525718f5
msgid ""
"`afm_mode` 设成 `group A/B` 却没有 `group` 数组：AFM 分支会失去预期分组信息。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting group A/B without a `group` array: the AFM branch lacks the "
"intended sublattice definition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:414
#: 521d3b7632cc4d6a94108e37be139b58
msgid "直接用 `Magmom Rotation` 处理没有初始磁矩的结构：旋转对象本身就不存在。"
msgstr ""
"Applying `Magmom Rotation` to a structure with no initial moments: there is "
"nothing to rotate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:416
#: 5b04022805aa4681a64aa20255000554
msgid "有机构象"
msgstr "Organic conformations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:420
#: fc628fcf328247bfa2afb1cad13ef3a8
msgid ""
"为有机分子或分子晶体生成构象样本，再叠加轻微原子扰动，得到更适合 NEP 训练的局"
"部结构分布。"
msgstr ""
"Generate conformations for an organic molecule or molecular crystal, then "
"add mild atomic perturbations to broaden the local structure distribution "
"for NEP training."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:424
#: 5309027d6cf1434c9ca729430fbbd9be
msgid "输入里包含有机分子，或者是分子晶体。"
msgstr "The input contains organic molecules or is a molecular crystal."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:425
#: df04fd98d9294faea839cacd93f617ae
msgid "希望同时覆盖扭转构象和局部热噪声，而不是只做刚性平移。"
msgstr ""
"The data should cover both torsional conformations and local thermal-like "
"noise, not only rigid translation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:429
#: 0e8d4ccbcd604bab84a096cae3c84c43
msgid ""
"`Organic Mol Config → Atomic Perturb → 导出 xyz → NEP Dataset Display 清洗 → "
"FPS`"
msgstr ""
"`Organic Mol Config → Atomic Perturb → export XYZ → clean in NEP Dataset "
"Display → FPS`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:433
#: 355359d9d8e14a2dbead7b882b3dcc0f
msgid "Step 1. `Organic Mol Config`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:435
#: 24c7c2685a9044f08cdb9bc1fd5e0fd6
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrganicMolConfigPBCCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"perturb_per_frame\": 8,\n"
"    \"torsion_range_deg\": [-25.0, 25.0],\n"
"    \"max_torsions_per_conf\": 2,\n"
"    \"gaussian_sigma\": 0.01,\n"
"    \"pbc_mode\": \"molecule in box\",\n"
"    \"local_cutoff\": 5,\n"
"    \"local_subtree\": 100,\n"
"    \"bond_detect_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_min_factor\": 0.75,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_factor\": 1.30,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_enable\": true,\n"
"    \"nonbond_min_factor\": 0.80,\n"
"    \"max_retries\": 50,\n"
"    \"mult_bond_factor\": 1.10,\n"
"    \"nonpbc_box_size\": 20.0,\n"
"    \"bo_c_const\": 0.35,\n"
"    \"bo_threshold\": 0.25,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 5\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:462
#: c3d62a840bb64c3dac10c7f12402f1c5
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 每帧输入扩出 8 个构象版本；主变化来自扭转角和局部高斯扰"
"动，而不是晶格变形。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Eight conformational variants per input frame. Their "
"main changes come from torsions and local Gaussian displacements, not "
"lattice deformation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:464
#: 50128311ddde4bab973952a2291a7d82
msgid "Step 2. `Atomic Perturb`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:466
#: 4c4d0a8532234523b7ce16cf6849b96b
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"PerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_distance\": 0.03,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 3,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": true,\n"
"    \"use_element_scaling\": false,\n"
"    \"element_scalings\": {},\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 6\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:482
#: bf02080e5c0c48429fd48b0d065332d5
msgid ""
"**每步预期输出：** 每个有机构象再扩出 3 个轻微原子热扰动版本；`organic=true` "
"会尽量保持分子内部拓扑不被原子级随机位移破坏。"
msgstr ""
"**Expected output:** Three mildly perturbed variants of every conformation. "
"With `organic=true`, molecular clusters are protected from independent "
"atomic displacements that would otherwise damage their internal topology."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:486
#: e3994e1cd93c4937a64ecc3f10fa3aea
msgid "同时覆盖扭转构象和局部热噪声"
msgstr "Covers torsional conformations and local thermal-like noise"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:487
#: 4bd219946c104791957c1259a9bd0a44
msgid "分子内部键拓扑更容易保持稳定"
msgstr "Better preserves intramolecular bond topology"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:488
#: 2d57a3dfef8948e28a1351c63c00e4cf
msgid "适合作为有机体系初始训练集或补样集"
msgstr "Suitable for an initial or augmentation set for organic systems"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:492
#: e91a997907ed4a6883ad1adbc6293f11
msgid "`organic` 没开：原子级扰动更容易拉坏分子内部键。"
msgstr ""
"Leaving `organic` disabled: independent atomic perturbations can distort "
"intramolecular bonds."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:493
#: 87861cc1d924478582b5e844cb140194
msgid "`torsion_range_deg` 设得太宽：容易生成明显高能或自相交构象。"
msgstr ""
"Using an overly wide `torsion_range_deg`: candidates are more likely to be "
"extremely high energy or self-intersecting."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:494
#: 6a642749cb90487486fe5112454562f7
msgid "先做大幅原子扰动再做构象采样：会把构象变化和非物理断键混在一起。"
msgstr ""
"Applying large atomic perturbations before conformational sampling: physical "
"torsion changes become mixed with unphysical bond breaking."

